WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.080
The jeogori sits right below the face, acting like a reflector for light.

2
00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:18.768
Its color and the light it reflects directly affect facial shadows, blemishes, and skin texture, either brightening or dulling your complexion.

3
00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:26.160
The skirt, on the other hand, is far from the face, so it only shapes the overall mood without actually changing your complexion.

4
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:36.144
So no matter how pretty the skirt is, if the jeogori color doesn't match your personal color, wrinkles look deeper and makeup can look off.

5
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:43.632
To look your absolute best, put all your attention into the jeogori's color and texture (matte vs. glossy) rather than the skirt.
